     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><u>Objective</u>: Have a tabPanel controlled by a for loop as the contents are repeated.</div><div><u>Problem</u>: Most likely incorrect placement of the for loop. Results in no-sub menu being created with random text being displayed &quot;tab-1810-1&quot;</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Nav Bar Title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                   navbarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Nav Bar Sub-title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              lapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">criteria</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                         fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                   </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Fi_fZlrOx-k/VpnWnPzNroI/AAAAAAAAA1s/TE8-B1hBNkU/s1600/Untitled.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Fi_fZlrOx-k/VpnWnPzNroI/AAAAAAAAA1s/TE8-B1hBNkU/s1600/Untitled.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395364575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qgQs7vXD7KzmSLXDyJbnO\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Fi_fZlrOx-k/VpnWnPzNroI/AAAAAAAAA1s/TE8-B1hBNkU/s320/Untitled.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"90\"></a></p><div><br></div><div>This problem is a repost, The above code is a simplified version of the original problem with better explanation of the problem.</div><div><br></div></div>"
